<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>UK education providers face growing pressure to do more with less. Admin burdens are rising, reporting requirements are increasing, and parents expect digital access to their children's progress. Bespoke software can help you streamline admin, track student data, and deliver the digital experience parents and students now expect - but most schools, colleges, and training providers are still running on legacy MIS platforms that were designed two decades ago and have been patched rather than modernised.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf education software consistently disappoints. The dominant MIS platforms are slow, inflexible, and require extensive training to perform basic tasks. Generic learning management systems handle content delivery but can't accommodate your specific curriculum structure, assessment framework, or reporting requirements. Parent portal tools built for generic use don't understand safeguarding protocols, can't differentiate between appropriate information sharing for different family situations, and lack the integration with your existing systems that would make them genuinely useful. The result is teaching staff spending evenings on data entry and parents frustrated by digital systems that offer less functionality than their banking app.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK schools, colleges, and training providers - from student information systems and learning platforms to parent portals and timetable management. We understand education workflows, from the classroom to the admin office, and we build systems that integrate with your existing MIS. Whether it's a bespoke assessment tracking system that matches your specific reporting framework, a parent portal that surfaces the right information to the right people with appropriate safeguarding controls, or a timetable management tool that handles your specific room and staff constraints, bespoke software fits how your institution actually works.</p>
<p>Education compliance is demanding and growing stricter. GDPR requirements for handling children's data, safeguarding obligations under Keeping Children Safe in Education, Ofsted inspection readiness, and DfE census reporting all demand robust data management. Bespoke software can maintain granular consent records for student data, enforce role-based access aligned with safeguarding protocols, automate DfE census submissions, and produce Ofsted-ready evidence packs on demand - capabilities that patched-together legacy systems simply can't match.</p>
<p>A UK multi-academy trust with six schools was spending two weeks per term producing standardised assessment reports across all sites because each school's MIS produced data in different formats. We built a bespoke assessment aggregation platform that pulled data from each school's MIS, normalised it to a common standard, and produced trust-wide reports automatically. Termly reporting time dropped from two weeks to two hours, the trust identified underperforming cohorts three months earlier than previously possible, and Ofsted specifically commended their data-driven approach during inspection.</p>
<p>Education is a sector where bespoke software delivers clear value. Every student, every lesson, and every assessment generates data. The opportunity is building software that turns that data into streamlined admin, better student tracking, and stronger parental engagement.</p>

